{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-index-bottom-in", "R-pinky-top", "R-index-home"],
  "note": "T1+T2 known: {L-pinky-top,L-ring-home}={K,V}; {L-index-bottom-in,R-pinky-top}={M,R}; rotation after T2 was {L-index-home,L-middle-home,L-pinky-home} so H/O may be on one of these + on R-index-home, but K/V and M/R are unchanged locations (only on L-pinky-top+L-ring-home and on L-index-bottom-in+R-pinky-top resp). After T3 obs S3 for chord {LpTop,LIndexBotIn,RpTop,RIndexHome}: LpTop = (K or V)∩S3; other->L-ring-home. {LIndexBotIn,RpTop} = {M,R}∩S3 (order unresolved). RIndexHome=(H or O)∩S3; next T4: press L-index-bottom-in but omit R-pinky-top to learn M vs R."
}

{
  "presses": ["R-middle-top", "R-ring-home", "L-ring-bottom", "L-middle-home"],
  "locks": {
    "L-ring-home": "V",
    "L-ring-bottom": "M",
    "R-middle-top": "J",
    "R-ring-home": "Y",
    "L-index-home-in": "T"
  },
  "note": "After turn11+12 deduce (no rotations): R-middle-top=J (since {J,Y}∩{J,T}={J}); L-index-home-in=T; R-ring-home=Y; L-ring-home=V; L-ring-bottom=M. Plan: next press 3-known+target => {R-middle-top,R-ring-home,L-ring-bottom,L-middle-home} to read letter on L-middle-home directly from returned set."
}

{
  "presses": ["R-index-top-in", "L-index-top-in", "R-middle-top", "R-middle-home"],
  "note": "T16: {R-index-top-in, R-index-bottom-in, L-index-top-in} = {E,Q,W}; R-index-home-in=L. Known locks: R-middle-top=J, R-middle-home=S. T17 press A=R-index-top-in + C=L-index-top-in + J + S -> get uncertain letters {x,y} for {A,C}. T18 planned press B=R-index-bottom-in + C + J + S -> get {u,v}; intersection of {x,y} and {u,v} gives letter on C; remaining give A,B. Then lock if sure."
}
